{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veteranen Instituut, IPNV, interview 918"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:42360"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veteranen Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ICNV  Nederlands Veteraneninstituut"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands Veteraneninstituut"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De geïnterviewde vertelt over zijn uitzending naar Voormalig Joegoslavië. De geïnterviewde vertelt over zijn opleiding en de korte voorbereiding voor hij op uitzending ging. Hij vertelt over de aankomst in Busovaca. De geïnterviewde was ambulancechauffeur en reed 4 à 5 keer per week. De geïnterviewde beschrijft hoe anders het gebied is en de moeilijkheid van het onpartijdig zijn. De situatie verbaasde hem steeds weer. De geïnterviewde vertelt over een beschieting in Sarajevo en gaat in op andere gevaarlijke situaties tijdens het konvooi rijden. De geïnterviewde vertelt wat de gevolgen van de oorlog voor een indruk op hem maakte. Hij vertelt over het uitdelen van goederen aan de lokale bevolking. De spanningen van de uitzending veranderde de geïnterviewde. De geïnterviewde vertelt over zijn problemen met aanpassen na terugkeer in Nederland, waaruit bleek dat hij last had van PTSS, en gaat in op zijn behandeling en herstel."}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"UNPROFOR\/UNPF-Voormalig Joegoslavie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Opleiding"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Chauffeur"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Transportbataljon"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hospik"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Rode Kruis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Konvooi"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Onpartijdigheid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Roadblock"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Beschietingen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Muhajedeen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Spanningen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Persoonlijke ontwikkeling"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"PTSS"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Humanitaire hulp"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lokale bevolking"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ongelukken"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Terug in burgermaatschappij"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Verwerking"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Psychische problemen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Militair hospitaal"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Waardering"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veteranenactiviteiten"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-12-10"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-02-14"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-12-10"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De collectie van het Interview-project Nederlandse Veteranen (IPNV) bestaat uit meer dan duizend  biografische interviews, die gehouden zijn met veteranen van nagenoeg alle conflicten en militaire missies waar Nederland bij betrokken is geweest.Van soldaat tot generaal, van hospik tot para, van gevechten op Nederlandse bodem in de Mei-dagen van 1940 tot de slag bij Chora in Afghanistan, alles komt aan bod in deze gevarieerde collectie. De geïnterviewden hebben bijgedragen aan een schat aan informatie voor onder andere beleidsmakers, onderzoekers, media en het geïnteresseerde publiek.Onderstaand treft u de links naar de metadata van alle interviews. De  interviews zijn om privacyredenen alleen na toestemming van het Veternanen Instituut toegankelijk. Deze toestemming kunt u aanvragen per dataset via tabblad 'Permission\".In het kader van het project Living Oral History Workbench, zijn een aantal interviews via automatische spraakherkenning geïndexeerd zodat ze doorzoekbaar zijn. Zie de onderstaande link naar Interviews Project Living Oral History Workbench."}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/7e30e380-9e02-4b15-a0af-f35286c3ecec","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/078ae626-cf18-4986-b1c8-883c2ab634fb"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/7e30e380-9e02-4b15-a0af-f35286c3ecec","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-8